#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:1
msgid "下一代平台工程运行手册"
msgstr "Next-generation platform engineering handbook"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:3
msgid ""
"工程合同与风险门禁。当前可运行入口、逐项实现和实际证据见[交付状态](../delivery/README.md)。本手册规定团队责任和验收边界；示意 "
"schema/API 不替代源码。OCI 准备、正式离线构建、软件候选及实板资格分别验收。"
msgstr ""
"Engineering contracts and risk gates. See [delivery "
"status](../delivery/README.md) for runnable entry points, individual "
"implementations and actual evidence. This handbook defines team "
"responsibilities and acceptance boundaries; illustrative schemas/APIs do not"
" replace source. OCI preparation, formal offline builds, software candidates"
" and physical qualification are accepted separately."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:5
msgid ""
"平台总体设计见 [next-generation-platform.md](next-generation-"
"platform.md)，外部产品、Board 和组件接入契约见 [integration-contracts.md](integration-"
"contracts.md)。本文负责把这些边界转换为约十人团队可以执行、审查和持续维护的工程规则；接口与目录的最终定义以上述设计文档为准。"
msgstr ""
"See [next-generation-platform.md](next-generation-platform.md) for the "
"platform design and [integration-contracts.md](integration-contracts.md) for"
" external product, Board and component contracts. This handbook turns those "
"boundaries into rules that a team of about ten can execute, review and "
"maintain. Those design documents define the final interfaces and "
"directories."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:7
msgid "1. 工程目标与完成的含义"
msgstr "1. Engineering goals and the meaning of completion"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:9
msgid ""
"工程系统要回答四件事：选择了什么、实现是否符合合同、实际资源与时序是否满足产品要求、交付的是否为验证过的那份产物。工具数量、测试条数、文档页数和流水线绿灯数量都不是目标。"
msgstr ""
"The engineering system must answer four questions: what was selected, "
"whether implementation meets its contract, whether actual resources and "
"timing meet product requirements, and whether the delivered artifact is the "
"one verified. Tool counts, test counts, page counts and green pipeline "
"counts are not goals."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:11
msgid "首版遵循以下原则："
msgstr "The first version follows these principles:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:13
msgid "一个默认配置入口，一个有效配置结果，一个软件依赖图；不同工具不能分别解释同一选择。"
msgstr ""
"One default configuration input, one resolved result and one software "
"dependency graph. Different tools must not interpret the same selection "
"independently."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:14
msgid "标准 C、CMake 和测试工具完成各自职责；自建工具只补足配置语义、硬件资源校验与证据绑定。"
msgstr ""
"Standard C, CMake and testing tools each do their own job. Custom tools add "
"only configuration semantics, hardware resource validation and evidence "
"binding."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:15
msgid "平台提供共同机制与诚实能力，产品拥有业务 worker、协议、分区、更新、健康和制造策略。"
msgstr ""
"The platform provides shared mechanisms and truthful capabilities. Products "
"own business workers, protocols, partitions, updates, health and "
"manufacturing policy."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:16
msgid "编译、主机模型、真实内核运行、ARM 链接、物理测量和发布资格分别记录，互相不能替代。"
msgstr ""
"Compilation, host models, actual kernel execution, ARM linking, physical "
"measurements and release qualification are recorded separately; none "
"substitutes for another."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:17
msgid "优先使失败路径、资源边界和并发合同可验证，再优化性能。不能通过删掉所有权或结清条件换取纸面速度。"
msgstr ""
"Make failure paths, resource boundaries and concurrency contracts verifiable"
" before optimizing performance. Never trade ownership or settlement "
"conditions for apparent speed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:18
msgid "每个阶段有可执行退出条件。计划完成、实现完成、软件验收、物理验收与发布资格是不同状态。"
msgstr ""
"Each stage has executable exit conditions. Plan completion, implementation "
"completion, software acceptance, physical acceptance and release "
"qualification are different states."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:20
msgid "当前用户延期物理设备操作。新工程模型可以先完成软件与 HIL 工具准备；物理阶段继续记录为未执行，直到获得真实站点和实际执行结果。"
msgstr ""
"The user has deferred physical device operations. The engineering model can "
"first deliver software and HIL tooling preparation; the physical stage "
"remains not executed until a real station and actual results are available."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:22
msgid "2. 目录、语言与依赖边界"
msgstr "2. Directories, languages and dependency boundaries"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:24
msgid "建议生产代码按下列职责组织。表格是目录约定，不是另一个自动加载或自动启动框架。"
msgstr ""
"Recommended production-code organization follows these responsibilities. "
"This table is a directory convention, not another automatic loading or "
"startup framework."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "目录"
msgstr "Directory"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "工程职责"
msgstr "Engineering responsibility"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`core/`"
msgstr "`core/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "小型共同类型、状态与基础合同，以及有边界的基础设施启动；不容纳产品主循环"
msgstr ""
"Small shared types, statuses and foundational contracts, with bounded "
"infrastructure startup; no product main loop."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`arch/`"
msgstr "`arch/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "CPU 本地中断状态、屏障、必要原子原语与可选计时基础"
msgstr ""
"CPU-local interrupt state, barriers, necessary atomic primitives and "
"optional timing foundations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`soc/`"
msgstr "`soc/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "精确 silicon/variant、clock、controller、IRQ/DMA 与私有 vendor SDK 集成"
msgstr ""
"Exact silicon/variant, clocks, controllers, IRQ/DMA and private vendor SDK "
"integration."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`io/`"
msgstr "`io/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "typed I/O 合同、明确的实现接入面与必要可移植适配"
msgstr ""
"Typed I/O contracts, explicit implementation integration surfaces and "
"necessary portable adapters."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`os/`"
msgstr "`os/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "有边界的 OS/backend 集成；应用 task 和调度策略留给产品"
msgstr ""
"Bounded OS/backend integration; application tasks and scheduling policy "
"belong to products."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`components/`"
msgstr "`components/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "可独立选择、测试和链接的共同组件"
msgstr ""
"Shared components that can be selected, tested and linked independently."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`tools/`"
msgstr "`tools/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "配置解析、构建入口、产物检查、证据和打包工具"
msgstr ""
"Configuration parsing, build entry points, artifact checks, evidence and "
"packaging tools."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "`tests/`"
msgstr "`tests/`"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "主机契约、故障模型、链接 fixture、外部 consumer 与 HIL 工具测试"
msgstr ""
"Host contracts, fault models, link fixtures, external consumers and HIL "
"tooling tests."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:37
msgid ""
"产品和 Board 可以是外部 package。公共示例展示产品组装，不成为平台内部必须链接的业务模块。维护中的 SoC 和 Board 使用明确的 "
"target，不通过扫描目录、名称匹配或隐式默认平台决定实现。"
msgstr ""
"Products and Boards may be external packages. Public examples demonstrate "
"product assembly without becoming mandatory platform business modules. "
"Maintained SoCs and Boards use explicit targets; directory scanning, name "
"matching and implicit default platforms never select implementations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:39
msgid "2.1 C11 生产代码与 C++ 测试隔离"
msgstr "2.1 Isolating C11 production code from C++ tests"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:41
msgid ""
"首版生产模块使用 C11；必要的 startup/CPU 原语使用受控汇编。生产目标不因为构建测试而获得 C++ runtime、异常、RTTI 或额外"
" STL 依赖。平台 public C header 必须自足，并提供需要的 C++ linkage 声明，使外部 C++ 产品可以正常消费 C "
"API。"
msgstr ""
"First-version production modules use C11; necessary startup/CPU primitives "
"use controlled assembly. Enabling tests must not add a C++ runtime, "
"exceptions, RTTI or STL dependencies to production targets. Public C headers"
" must be self-contained and provide required C++ linkage declarations so "
"external C++ products can consume the C API."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:43
msgid ""
"主机 C API、组件和 provider 的新增行为测试统一使用 C++17、GoogleTest 和 GoogleMock。测试 "
"helper、fault injection、host fixture 与 mock SDK 仅进入测试 target，不能通过目录全局 "
"include/define 混入生产编译。Python 工具使用 stdlib unittest，不要求嵌入式工程采用 Python "
"runtime。历史 C 模型测试作为已有回归继续执行，新行为按下述 TDD 约束扩展。"
msgstr ""
"New behavior tests for host C APIs, components and providers use C++17, "
"GoogleTest and GoogleMock. Helpers, fault injection, host fixtures and mock "
"SDKs belong only to test targets; directory-global includes/defines must not"
" leak into production compilation. Python tools use stdlib unittest and do "
"not require a Python runtime in embedded firmware. Historical C models "
"remain regressions; new behavior follows the TDD contract below."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:45
msgid ""
"至少验证三个消费边界：纯 C public header consumer、C++ public header consumer、真实外部 "
"product consumer。测试打开与关闭时，生产 target 的接口和资源合同保持一致；instrumentation profile "
"的编译产物另行标识。"
msgstr ""
"Verify at least three consumption boundaries: a pure C public-header "
"consumer, a C++ public-header consumer and a real external product consumer."
" Production target interfaces and resource contracts stay consistent with "
"tests enabled or disabled; instrumentation-profile artifacts are identified "
"separately."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:47
msgid "2.2 公共头必须形成真正的编译边界"
msgstr "2.2 Public headers must establish a real compile boundary"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:49
msgid ""
"public、provider 和 private 头在物理目录上分开。普通 consumer 的 include 路径仅包含所选 public "
"根；SoC、Board 和实现适配 target 才获得需要的 provider/private 根。不能把所有头放在同一 PUBLIC 根，再用“不要"
" include”约定宣称隔离。"
msgstr ""
"Separate public, provider and private headers physically. Ordinary consumers"
" receive only selected public include roots; SoC, Board and implementation "
"adapter targets receive the provider/private roots they need. Placing every "
"header in one PUBLIC root and saying “do not include it” does not establish "
"isolation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:51
msgid ""
"检查同时包含正例和反例：公共消费者能编译必要类型；它无法直接 include vendor、私有 controller 或实现注册头。SDK "
"自身源码可见不等于任意 target 都应继承其 include 路径。"
msgstr ""
"Checks include positive and negative cases: public consumers compile "
"necessary types but cannot directly include vendor, private-controller or "
"implementation-registration headers. Visible SDK source does not mean every "
"target should inherit its include paths."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:53
msgid ""
"Vendor 源码和规则独立管理。公共结构不得含 vendor 类型，也不得要求 product 手动继承 vendor 编译宏来使用平台 public"
" API。"
msgstr ""
"Manage vendor source and rules separately. Public structures must not "
"contain vendor types or require products to inherit vendor compilation "
"macros manually to use public platform APIs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:55
msgid "3. 标准 CMake 是唯一软件依赖图"
msgstr "3. Standard CMake is the only software dependency graph"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:57
msgid ""
"组件、SoC、Board、测试与产品使用普通 CMake target 表达源码、usage requirements "
"和链接关系。`PUBLIC`、`PRIVATE`、`INTERFACE` 的区别是合同的一部分；不能依赖目录全局的 include、link "
"或编译选项。"
msgstr ""
"Components, SoCs, Boards, tests and products express sources, usage "
"requirements and link relationships through ordinary CMake targets. "
"`PUBLIC`, `PRIVATE` and `INTERFACE` distinctions are contractual; do not "
"depend on directory-global includes, links or compile options."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:59
msgid "显式列出维护中的源码与已知生成输出。首版不通过 `GLOB_RECURSE` 扫描发现任意组件。"
msgstr ""
"List maintained sources and known generated outputs explicitly. The first "
"version does not discover arbitrary components through `GLOB_RECURSE`."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:60
msgid "CMake target 是软件依赖权威。配置 JSON 和 generator 不再维护一份“组件 A 依赖 B”的平行图。"
msgstr ""
"CMake targets are authoritative for software dependencies. Configuration "
"JSON and generators do not maintain a parallel “component A depends on B” "
"graph."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:61
msgid "所选组件的合法性由 target 定义和必要语义校验确认；generator 只输出选择与配置事实，CMake 完成依赖传播与构建顺序。"
msgstr ""
"Target definitions and necessary semantic checks establish legal component "
"selection. Generators emit selections and configuration facts; CMake "
"propagates dependencies and determines build order."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:62
msgid "不自建链接器、不重新实现 CMake 的 target graph、测试发现或增量构建。"
msgstr ""
"Do not build a custom linker or reimplement CMake target graphs, test "
"discovery or incremental builds."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:63
msgid ""
"需要保留的 startup、vector、静态绑定和强 IRQ 必须有明确的链接根与 ELF 检查。不得使用全局 `whole-archive` "
"或删除保留根来掩盖组装问题；默认架构不生成通用设备 registry。"
msgstr ""
"Startup, vectors, static bindings and strong IRQ handlers that must survive "
"linking require explicit retention roots and ELF checks. Global `whole-"
"archive` or deleting retention roots must not conceal assembly defects. The "
"default architecture does not generate a generic device registry."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:64
msgid ""
"所有 CPU/FPU/ABI、优化和 instrumentation 选项通过命名的配置 target 传播，不能在不同子目录追加相互覆盖的 "
"flags。"
msgstr ""
"Propagate CPU/FPU/ABI, optimization and instrumentation options through "
"named configuration targets, rather than appending conflicting flags in "
"different subdirectories."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:66
msgid ""
"组件的源码、public/private includes 与 target dependency 留在组件的 CMake 定义中。可选能力 "
"metadata 只描述实现事实，不能重新规定软件依赖或凭 metadata 宣称能力已经验证。"
msgstr ""
"Component sources, public/private includes and target dependencies stay in "
"their CMake definitions. Optional capability metadata describes "
"implementation facts; it must not redefine software dependencies or claim "
"validation solely from metadata."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:68
msgid ""
"生成器输出应当小且可检查：有效配置、配置头、选中目标标识、静态资源绑定和必要 linker layout。普通 typed C "
"初始化与数据路径仍由人维护。避免为了减少几行初始化代码生成业务 worker、调度算法、驱动状态机或通用执行 DSL。"
msgstr ""
"Generator output should be small and inspectable: resolved configuration, "
"configuration headers, selected-target identities, static resource bindings "
"and necessary linker layouts. Humans maintain ordinary typed C "
"initialization and data paths. Do not generate business workers, scheduling "
"algorithms, driver state machines or a general execution DSL to save a few "
"initialization lines."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:70
msgid "4. 首版配置：assembly.toml 到 resolved.json"
msgstr "4. First-version configuration: assembly.toml to resolved.json"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:72
msgid "4.1 唯一默认输入模型"
msgstr "4.1 One default input model"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:74
msgid ""
"装配采用 product-owned TOML schema 2 的 `assembly.toml`，引用明确的 Board，按其精确料号选择 "
"SoC，再选择 OS/backend、组件、实例资源和预算。Python 标准 `tomllib` 解析，严格字段模型同时提供 editor "
"schema；CLI 提供 `init/list-bindings/check/explain/generate`。"
msgstr ""
"Assembly uses product-owned TOML schema 2 in `assembly.toml`: reference an "
"explicit Board, select its exact SoC part, then select the OS/backend, "
"components, instance resources and budgets. Standard Python `tomllib` parses"
" it; strict field models also provide editor schemas. The CLI exposes "
"`init/list-bindings/check/explain/generate`."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:76
msgid ""
"`assembly.toml` 不包含任意软件依赖声明、shell 命令或代码表达式。它不能通过字符串重新定义 CPU "
"指令集、ABI、controller 功能或任意编译 flags。模式和优化选项从受支持的命名 profile 选择，实际 flags "
"由工具链规则生成并记录。"
msgstr ""
"`assembly.toml` contains no arbitrary software dependency declarations, "
"shell commands or code expressions. Strings cannot redefine CPU instruction "
"sets, ABIs, controller functions or arbitrary compile flags. Modes and "
"optimization options come from supported named profiles; toolchain rules "
"produce and record actual flags."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:78
msgid ""
"首版不引入 `overlay`、`inherit`、递归 merge 或其他配置语言。外部产品通过完整、显式的 assembly "
"选择表达需求。相同字段不能在 assembly、Board 输入、CMake cache 和环境变量中各有一套覆盖规则。"
msgstr ""
"The first version introduces no `overlay`, `inherit`, recursive merge or "
"additional configuration language. External products express requirements "
"through complete, explicit assemblies. The same field must not have separate"
" override rules in assembly, Board input, CMake cache and environment "
"variables."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:80
msgid ""
"SoC 输入声明准确变体、物理内存、controller 与实现能力；Board 输入声明晶振、布线和已审资源路由；product assembly "
"声明应用选择与所需容量。字段的责任归属由 schema 固定，冲突失败，不由最后一个输入获胜。"
msgstr ""
"SoC inputs declare exact variants, physical memory, controllers and "
"implemented capabilities. Board inputs declare oscillators, wiring and "
"reviewed resource routes. Product assemblies declare application choices and"
" required capacities. Schemas fix field ownership; conflicts fail rather "
"than letting the last input win."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:82
msgid "4.2 一次解析，派生物只有一个来源"
msgstr "4.2 Parse once; derived outputs have one source"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:84
msgid ""
"配置阶段构造冻结 `ConfigurationIR`、`ControllerIR`、`EndpointIR` 和 "
"`MemoryBudgetIR`。构造器直接消费 IR，`resolved.json` 保存相同决定、输入身份与解析器版本。以下内容由同一次解析派生："
msgstr ""
"Configuration constructs frozen `ConfigurationIR`, `ControllerIR`, "
"`EndpointIR` and `MemoryBudgetIR` values. Constructors consume IR directly; "
"`resolved.json` retains the same decisions, input identities and resolver "
"version. The same resolution derives:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:86
msgid "编译所需常量、独立私有实例、只读 face 与 `nexus_factory.h` 的 typed ID/getter。"
msgstr ""
"Compile-time constants, separate private instances, read-only faces and "
"typed IDs/getters in `nexus_factory.h`."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:87
msgid "供 CMake 使用的明确选择值。"
msgstr "Explicit selections for CMake."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:88
msgid "Board 路由和资源冲突检查结果。"
msgstr "Board route and resource-conflict check results."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:89
msgid "product layout 的 linker/region 定义。"
msgstr "Linker/region definitions for product layouts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:90
msgid "配置摘要与资源预算输入。"
msgstr "Configuration digests and resource-budget inputs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:92
msgid ""
"这些派生文件不得手工编辑。`resolved.json` "
"也不是用户输入；缺失或与输入身份不符时必须重新生成，不能从旧生成目录回退。配置失败不留下可被当作成功结果消费的部分 bundle。"
msgstr ""
"Never edit derived files manually. `resolved.json` is not user input either:"
" missing or mismatched input identities require regeneration, without "
"fallback to an old generated directory. Failed configuration leaves no "
"partial bundle that can be consumed as success."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:94
msgid ""
"解析器拒绝重复 TOML table/key、重复 JSON 事实 key、未知字段、错误类型、越界值、矛盾选择、不存在的输入、未实现能力、非法 "
"IRQ/DMA/pin route 与 layout overlap。输入声明的 capability 不能覆盖实现 capability。字符串到 "
"C/header/CMake 的转换必须有明确编码与转义，不把用户数据当脚本执行。"
msgstr ""
"The resolver rejects duplicate TOML tables/keys, duplicate JSON fact keys, "
"unknown fields, wrong types, out-of-range values, contradictory choices, "
"missing inputs, unimplemented capabilities, illegal IRQ/DMA/pin routes and "
"overlapping layouts. Declared capabilities cannot override implementation "
"capabilities. String conversion to C/headers/CMake requires explicit "
"encoding and escaping; user data is never executed as a script."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:96
msgid "4.3 独立构建根与 cache"
msgstr "4.3 Separate build roots and caches"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:98
msgid ""
"每个 `assembly + toolchain + profile` 组合使用独立 build root；CMake cache "
"不能把同一根悄悄切成另一种 silicon、Board、backend 或 ABI。工具入口验证其身份，不匹配时要求新的构建根或执行有边界的重配置。"
msgstr ""
"Each `assembly + toolchain + profile` combination uses a separate build "
"root. A CMake cache must not silently switch a root to different silicon, "
"Board, backend or ABI. Entry points verify identity and require a new root "
"or bounded reconfiguration on mismatch."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:100
msgid ""
"构建 cache 只提高速度，不建立验收身份。CI 可复用经过 key 隔离的 cache，但正式候选至少有 clean build 证据。cache "
"key 应包含工具环境、配置和依赖身份，而不是只用 branch name。"
msgstr ""
"Caches improve speed without establishing acceptance identity. CI may reuse "
"correctly keyed caches, but formal candidates need at least clean-build "
"evidence. Keys include tool environment, configuration and dependency "
"identity rather than only branch names."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:102
msgid "4.4 Kconfig 的位置"
msgstr "4.4 The role of Kconfig"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:104
msgid "首版没有 Kconfig frontend。Kconfig 不是资源安全、静态组装或 CMake 构建的必需条件。"
msgstr ""
"The first version has no Kconfig frontend. Resource safety, static assembly "
"and CMake builds do not require Kconfig."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:106
msgid ""
"若未来配置规模证明交互式 choice/dependency UI 有价值，可以另行实现 Kconfig frontend，把选择转换为同一 typed"
" IR 合同。届时必须确定唯一权威前端，并维持相同语义校验；不能让 Kconfig、TOML 和 CMake cache 同时成为真源，也不能让隐式 "
"`select/default` 绕过未实现能力检查。"
msgstr ""
"If configuration scale later justifies an interactive choice/dependency UI, "
"implement a separate Kconfig frontend targeting the same typed IR contract. "
"Define one authoritative frontend and preserve semantic checks. Kconfig, "
"TOML and CMake cache must not all become sources of truth, and implicit "
"`select/default` must not bypass unimplemented-capability checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:108
msgid "5. 外部 package 接入"
msgstr "5. External package integration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:110
msgid "5.1 组件 package"
msgstr "5.1 Component packages"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:112
msgid ""
"组件提供普通 CMake target、明确的 public 头、private 实现和验证范围。应用显式链接所需组件。组件不能在被 "
"`add_subdirectory` 时启动线程、注册产品 main、读取设备或改变外部环境。"
msgstr ""
"A component provides an ordinary CMake target, explicit public headers, "
"private implementation and validation scope. Applications link it "
"explicitly. `add_subdirectory` must not start threads, register product main"
" functions, read devices or change the external environment."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:114
msgid ""
"组件所需硬件通过 typed port 和调用方注入接入。是否需要 worker、queue、storage 和 deadline 必须写入合同，由 "
"product 选择并提供或显式批准；不能隐藏在组件初始化副作用中。"
msgstr ""
"Required hardware enters through typed ports and caller injection. Worker, "
"queue, storage and deadline requirements must be contractual and provided or"
" explicitly approved by products, rather than hidden initialization side "
"effects."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:116
msgid "5.2 Board package"
msgstr "5.2 Board package"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:118
msgid ""
"Board package 包含准确 board/silicon 身份、声明输入、资源 manifest 和有边界的 C/CMake "
"wiring。它不拥有产品 task、私有 protocol、product partition 或制造凭据。板上器件和路由存在不等于已经验证电气行为。"
msgstr ""
"A Board package contains exact board/silicon identity, declared inputs, a "
"resource manifest and bounded C/CMake wiring. It owns no product tasks, "
"private protocols, product partitions or manufacturing credentials. The "
"existence of onboard devices and routes does not establish electrical "
"validation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:120
msgid ""
"声明输入须覆盖实际编译的 Board 源码及生成所需文件。package 接入前检查 route、资源冲突、variant/density、clock "
"与必要安全初始状态。hash 绑定只证明输入身份，不自动隔离任意 CMake 代码；正式构建环境仍按可信源码与受控环境运行。"
msgstr ""
"Declared inputs cover compiled Board sources and files needed for "
"generation. Before integration, check routes, resource conflicts, "
"variant/density, clocks and necessary safe initial states. Hashes prove "
"input identity without isolating arbitrary CMake execution; formal builds "
"still use trusted source and controlled environments."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:122
msgid "5.3 产品 package 与 SDK"
msgstr "5.3 Product packages and SDKs"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:124
msgid ""
"产品仓库提供 "
"assembly、main/workers、业务调度、protocol、分区、更新和健康策略，显式消费平台与组件。平台的标准初始化只处理基础设施，不自动生成应用。"
msgstr ""
"Product repositories provide assemblies, main/workers, business scheduling, "
"protocols, partitions, updates and health policy. They consume platform and "
"components explicitly. Standard platform initialization handles "
"infrastructure without generating applications."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:126
msgid ""
"首版承诺范围以可重定位 source SDK 为主。binary SDK、稳定 ABI、支持窗口和 LTS 各自需要独立策略与证据。每个正式 "
"source package 需用包外的真实 C/C++ consumer 从新目录验证；源码树内成功不能代替 relocatable package "
"验证。"
msgstr ""
"The first version primarily promises a relocatable source SDK. Binary SDKs, "
"stable ABI, support windows and LTS each need separate policy and evidence. "
"Every formal source package must be verified by real C/C++ consumers outside"
" the package in fresh directories; success inside the source tree does not "
"establish relocatability."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:128
msgid ""
"外部 package 以准确版本或 source commit/digest 固定。按名称自动下载最新 package 的行为不能进入正式候选构建。"
msgstr ""
"Pin external packages to exact versions or source commits/digests. "
"Automatically downloading the newest package by name must not enter formal "
"candidate builds."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:130
msgid "6. 工具环境、工具锁与入口"
msgstr "6. Tool environments, locks and entry points"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:132
msgid "6.1 少量工具，各自负责一个问题"
msgstr "6.1 A small set of tools, each with one responsibility"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "职责"
msgstr "Responsibility"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "首版工具选择"
msgstr "First-version tool choice"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "构建和测试编排"
msgstr "Build and test orchestration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "CMake、Ninja、CTest"
msgstr "CMake、Ninja、CTest"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "production 编译"
msgstr "Production compilation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "锁定的 ARM GCC；Native GCC 提供对应软件验证环境"
msgstr ""
"Locked ARM GCC; Native GCC supplies the matching software-validation "
"environment."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "主机 C/C++ 测试"
msgstr "Host C/C++ tests"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "锁定的 GoogleTest／GoogleMock；不传播至 production target"
msgstr "Locked GoogleTest/GoogleMock; no propagation to production targets."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "C/C++ 格式与精选分析"
msgstr "C/C++ formatting and selected analysis"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "同一锁定版本系列的 clang-format、clang-tidy"
msgstr "clang-format and clang-tidy from the same locked version series."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "配置、证据与打包工具"
msgstr "Configuration, evidence and packaging tools"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "Python；工具测试使用 stdlib unittest；Ruff 统一 Python 格式/lint"
msgstr ""
"Python; tool tests use stdlib unittest; Ruff provides consistent Python "
"formatting/lint."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "正式构建环境"
msgstr "Formal build environment"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "按 digest 固定的 Linux OCI image"
msgstr "Linux OCI image pinned by digest."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:143
msgid ""
"不默认叠加多个 formatter、多个同类 analyzer 或多个构建系统。若第二种工具能证明独有价值，再给它明确 "
"owner、规则和维护成本。外部工具检查结果须由实际执行产生，不能将配置文件存在当作检查通过。"
msgstr ""
"Do not stack multiple formatters, equivalent analyzers or build systems by "
"default. Add a second tool only when its distinct value is demonstrated, "
"with explicit ownership, rules and maintenance cost. Tool checks need actual"
" execution; a configuration file is not evidence of success."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:145
msgid "6.2 一个正式工具链锁"
msgstr "6.2 One formal toolchain lock"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:147
msgid ""
"一份 toolchain/environment lock 固定 ARM/Native "
"compiler、binutils/sysroot、CMake、Ninja、Python、formatter/analyzer、Ruff 和 build"
" image digest。安装入口、CI 与发布工具读取这份锁，不能分别写版本。"
msgstr ""
"One toolchain/environment lock pins ARM/Native compilers, binutils/sysroots,"
" CMake, Ninja, Python, formatters/analyzers, Ruff and the build-image "
"digest. Installers, CI and release tools consume it rather than declaring "
"independent versions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:149
msgid ""
"锁记录准确版本、内容 digest、合法来源与校验方式。版本字符串本身不足以标识编译器/sysroot 的实际 "
"bytes。跨宿主平台可有明确的开发环境条目，但正式候选先限定一个经过验证的 Linux 环境，避免把未验证的宿主组合加入发布承诺。"
msgstr ""
"The lock records exact versions, content digests, legal origins and "
"verification methods. Version strings alone do not identify compiler/sysroot"
" bytes. Host platforms may have explicit development entries, but formal "
"candidates initially use one verified Linux environment, without promising "
"unverified host combinations."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:151
msgid ""
"源依赖使用单独的 dependencies lock，固定 source revision、内容、来源和许可。源码锁与工具锁职责不同，不把 "
"compiler 安装和组件依赖混成另一个软件依赖求解器。"
msgstr ""
"A separate dependencies lock pins source revisions, contents, origins and "
"licenses. Source and tool locks have distinct responsibilities; do not "
"combine compiler installation and component dependencies into another "
"software dependency solver."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:153
msgid "6.3 一个薄入口，直接调用原生工具"
msgstr "6.3 One thin entry point calling native tools directly"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:155
msgid ""
"`tools/dev/dev.py` 调用真实 CMake、CTest、style 与 TDD gate，传播 exit code "
"并验证新鲜测试报告。preset 决定构建目录；额外原生命令参数直接传递，assembly 仍由唯一解析器解释。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/dev/dev.py` calls real CMake, CTest, style and TDD gates, propagates "
"exit codes and verifies fresh test reports. Presets choose build "
"directories; additional native arguments pass through directly, while the "
"sole resolver interprets assembly."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:165
msgid ""
"local 与 CI 调用同一入口和同一底层命令。CI yaml 负责触发、权限、矩阵和 artifact "
"transport，不重复另一套配置解析或检查算法。命令、工作目录、非敏感环境摘要与 exit code进入执行记录；凭据不能进入日志和产物。"
msgstr ""
"Local development and CI use the same entry point and underlying commands. "
"CI YAML handles triggers, permissions, matrices and artifact transport "
"without duplicating configuration parsing or checking algorithms. Records "
"retain commands, working directories, non-sensitive environment summaries "
"and exit codes; credentials never enter logs or artifacts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:167
msgid "7. Profile、资源预算与性能门禁"
msgstr "7. Profiles, resource budgets and performance gates"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:169
msgid "7.1 调试、benchmark 与量产是不同身份"
msgstr "7.1 Debugging, benchmarking and production have different identities"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:171
msgid ""
"development profile 提供符号、调试诊断和适当检查；Native sanitizer profile 提供 "
"ASan/UBSan；benchmark profile 控制测量装置和最少 instrumentation；production profile "
"固定实际优化、ABI、诊断与资源选择。"
msgstr ""
"Development profiles provide symbols, diagnostics and appropriate checks; "
"Native sanitizer profiles provide ASan/UBSan; benchmark profiles control "
"measurement fixtures and minimize instrumentation; production profiles fix "
"actual optimization, ABI, diagnostics and resource choices."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:173
msgid ""
"这些 profile 的产物不能互相继承资格。生产 mirror "
"可以保留调试符号，符号存在本身不改变设备合同；但编译选项、插桩或运行代码改变时，必须记录新产物身份。instrumented "
"timing结果不能直接宣称是量产镜像时序，实际 release image仍须完成必要验收。"
msgstr ""
"Profiles do not inherit each other’s artifact qualification. Production "
"mirrors may retain debug symbols, whose presence alone does not change "
"device contracts. Changes in flags, instrumentation or runtime code require "
"new artifact identities. Instrumented timing is not production-image timing;"
" actual release images still need the required acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:175
msgid ""
"首版不预设 O3、Os 或 LTO 永远最优。用少量代表工作负载比较 O2/Os/O3 与 LTO，随后选择一到两个正式优化 "
"profile。更改profile必须重新执行编译、ABI/静态绑定/IRQ、正确性、外部 consumer 与资源检查。优化规则不能被调用方任意 "
"flag覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"The first version does not presume O3, Os or LTO is always best. Compare "
"O2/Os/O3 and LTO on representative workloads, then choose one or two formal "
"optimization profiles. Profile changes rerun compilation, ABI/static-"
"binding/IRQ, correctness, external-consumer and resource checks. Caller-"
"supplied flags cannot override optimization rules arbitrarily."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:177
msgid ""
"量产profile保留具体合同必需的参数、request状态、动态借用/撤销、资源和安全检查；固定端口已在构建与控制路径成立的class/owner/lifecycle事实，不因此重新加到每次GPIO数据调用。调用上下文与单owner组织前提按各API明确，debug身份断言不被宣传为C权限隔离。可以关闭纯调试诊断，不能通过"
" `NDEBUG` 删除必要失败处理。默认不启用 `fast-math` 等改变数值合同的优化。"
msgstr ""
"Production profiles retain necessary parameter, request-state, dynamic-"
"borrow/revocation, resource and safety checks. Class/owner/lifecycle facts "
"already established for fixed ports during build and control paths need not "
"be rechecked on every GPIO data call. APIs define calling context and "
"single-owner assumptions; debug identity assertions are not C permission "
"isolation. Pure debug diagnostics may be disabled, but `NDEBUG` must not "
"remove necessary failure handling. Optimizations that change numerical "
"contracts, such as `fast-math`, are disabled by default."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:179
msgid "7.2 预算来自产品，不来自库的宣传数字"
msgstr "7.2 Budgets come from products, not library advertising"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:181
msgid ""
"product assembly提供经评审的 Flash、静态 RAM、MSP/PSP、task "
"stack、heap/pool、buffer、deadline与负载假设。平台验证预算表达合法，真实产物和现场测量验证满足性。合理默认值也不等于产品已批准预算。"
msgstr ""
"Product assemblies provide reviewed Flash, static RAM, MSP/PSP, task-stack, "
"heap/pool, buffer and deadline budgets, plus workload assumptions. The "
"platform validates their expression; actual artifacts and field measurements"
" verify satisfaction. Reasonable defaults are not product-approved budgets."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:183
msgid ""
"资源报告至少区分：Flash LOAD bytes与layout空间、`.data/.bss`、链接保留heap/MSP、task/queue "
"storage、管理域heap、运行时high-water和最小余量。不能把ELF文件大小、含debug的section "
"Total或仅text+bss作为全部设备成本。"
msgstr ""
"Resource reports distinguish Flash LOAD bytes from layout space, "
"`.data/.bss`, linker-reserved heap/MSP, task/queue storage, management-"
"domain heaps, runtime high-water marks and minimum margins. ELF file size, "
"section Total including debug, or text+bss alone is not total device cost."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:185
msgid ""
"每个启用实例有明确资源成本。先按真实 BOM裁剪未使用controller与legacy "
"storage，再讨论抽象开销。优化长期热路径前应测量固定pool容量、lookup/critical "
"duration、copy次数和后台worker成本。"
msgstr ""
"Every enabled instance has an explicit resource cost. Trim unused "
"controllers and legacy storage against the actual BOM before discussing "
"abstraction overhead. Before optimizing hot paths, measure fixed-pool "
"capacity, lookup/critical-section duration, copies and background-worker "
"cost."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:187
msgid "7.3 三类性能检查"
msgstr "7.3 Three classes of performance checks"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "检查"
msgstr "Check"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "执行环境与门禁"
msgstr "Execution environment and gate"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "静态资源"
msgstr "Static resources"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "在PR检查实际ELF/map，阻断绝对预算越界，并报告与同profile基线的增量"
msgstr ""
"PRs inspect actual ELF/maps, block absolute-budget violations and report "
"changes against a baseline of the same profile."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "受控benchmark"
msgstr "Controlled benchmarks"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "主机或专用MCU runner记录实际成功工作量、原始时间/cycles、样本分布、测量开销与环境；共享云runner的小时间差仅作趋势"
msgstr ""
"Host or dedicated MCU runners record successful work, raw time/cycles, "
"sample distributions, measurement overhead and environment; small timing "
"differences on shared cloud runners are trends only."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "产品时序"
msgstr "Product timing"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "专用HIL在真实production artifact、负载和干扰下检查deadline、IRQ响应、传输结清与资源余量"
msgstr ""
"Dedicated HIL checks deadlines, IRQ response, transfer settlement and "
"resource margins under actual production artifacts, loads and interference."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:195
msgid ""
"benchmark必须校验成功工作量，不能把FULL、错误快速返回或丢弃消息计成成功吞吐。预生成测试输入；避免把不相关的key格式化、日志输出和测量存储混入目标区间。记录mean、分位数、最大观测值以及失败/重试/丢弃，不用平均吞吐掩盖尾部延迟。"
msgstr ""
"Benchmarks validate successful work; FULL, fast error returns or discarded "
"messages must not count as successful throughput. Pregenerate inputs and "
"exclude unrelated key formatting, logging and measurement storage from the "
"measured interval. Record means, percentiles, maximum observations and "
"failures/retries/drops; average throughput must not conceal tail latency."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:197
msgid ""
"MCU计时记录clock、flash wait state、FPU配置、IRQ/负载模式、counter "
"wrap和instrumentation开销。CPU "
"cycle测量与wire/IRQ端到端测量职责不同。最大观测时长不是严格WCET证明；产品必须声明测量条件、分析范围和保留余量。"
msgstr ""
"MCU timing records clocks, Flash wait states, FPU settings, IRQ/load modes, "
"counter wrap and instrumentation overhead. CPU-cycle measurements and "
"wire/IRQ end-to-end measurements have different responsibilities. Maximum "
"observed duration is not a strict WCET proof; products declare measurement "
"conditions, analysis scope and reserved margin."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:199
msgid ""
"不在共享CI runner用易抖动的微秒阈值阻断普通功能PR。需要相对时序门禁时，先建立专用runner校准和可重复基线，再评审容差与误报处理。"
msgstr ""
"Do not block ordinary feature PRs with unstable microsecond thresholds on "
"shared CI runners. Relative timing gates require calibrated dedicated "
"runners and repeatable baselines before tolerances and false-positive "
"handling are reviewed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:201
msgid "8. 五层验证流水线"
msgstr "8. A five-layer validation pipeline"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:203
msgid "8.1 Fast local：帮助开发者尽早发现问题"
msgstr "8.1 Fast local: find problems early"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:205
msgid ""
"运行输入/schema校验、已改owned文件格式、增量编译和相关契约测试。涉及公共接口或跨层状态时，开发者主动执行相应集成集合。local结果给出明确范围，不直接成为发布资格。"
msgstr ""
"Run input/schema checks, formatting for changed owned files, incremental "
"compilation and relevant contract tests. Public interfaces and cross-layer "
"state changes require the developer to run applicable integration sets. "
"Local results state their scope and do not directly qualify a release."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:207
msgid ""
"低影响文档或纯格式修改使用对应校验，不为每段文字创建镜像实现的测试。行为、状态、资源或错误语义改变时，测试必须证明用户可观察的成功与失败路径。"
msgstr ""
"Low-impact documentation and formatting changes use appropriate checks; do "
"not create implementation-mirroring tests for each paragraph. Behavior, "
"state, resource or error-semantic changes need observable success and "
"failure-path tests."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:209
msgid "8.2 PR：验证共同合同没有被破坏"
msgstr "8.2 PR: verify shared contracts remain intact"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:211
msgid ""
"必需集合包括：owned "
"production编译与精选warnings、格式、精选静态规则、关键完整Native契约及ASan/UBSan、公共头隔离、真实外部consumer，以及两SoC乘两backend的代表ARM链接和资源预算检查。"
msgstr ""
"Required checks include owned-production compilation and selected warnings, "
"formatting, selected static rules, key complete Native contracts with "
"ASan/UBSan, public-header isolation, real external consumers and "
"representative ARM linking/resource checks for two SoCs × two backends."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:213
msgid ""
"配置解析、public "
"API、ownership、IRQ/DMA、同步、linker、toolchain和发布工具改变时，触发跨层完整检查。选择性测试依据显式依赖和风险规则，不能只按修改路径猜测影响。所选检查计划进入报告，避免没有测试被选择却显示passed。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration parsing, public API, ownership, IRQ/DMA, synchronization, "
"linker, toolchain and release-tool changes trigger full cross-layer checks. "
"Selective testing follows explicit dependencies and risk rules, not path-"
"only guesses. Report the selected plan so an empty selection cannot appear "
"passed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:215
msgid ""
"测试覆盖失败语义与不变量，包括pool耗尽、stale reference、busy/retry、部分初始化、timeout/cancel "
"race、cleanup失败与buffer最终归还。Native fault model证明其模型合同；它不证明真实MCU电气或DMA结清。"
msgstr ""
"Tests cover failure semantics and invariants: exhausted pools, stale "
"references, busy/retry, partial initialization, timeout/cancel races, "
"cleanup failures and final buffer return. Native fault models prove their "
"model contracts, not real MCU electrical behavior or DMA settlement."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:217
msgid "8.3 Nightly：验证广度和复杂路径"
msgstr "8.3 Nightly: verify breadth and complex paths"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:219
msgid ""
"执行全部维护Board/profile、完整source "
"SDKconsumer、fault/property/fuzz与较长软件负载，并保存资源趋势。依赖/工具升级、优化探索、第二编译器或跨宿主检查可在这里先评估，再决定是否进入正式支持。"
msgstr ""
"Run all maintained Boards/profiles, complete source-SDK consumers, "
"fault/property/fuzz checks and longer software workloads; retain resource "
"trends. Evaluate dependency/tool upgrades, optimization exploration, second "
"compilers and additional hosts here before adding formal support."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:221
msgid ""
"nightly发现关键回归后，应将可重复的最小验证纳入PR集合。夜间绿灯不补足未执行的PR必需检查，也不允许无限增长矩阵而没有维护者和能力承诺。"
msgstr ""
"Turn repeatable minimum checks for critical nightly regressions into PR "
"checks. Nightly success does not replace unexecuted mandatory PR checks or "
"justify an unlimited matrix without maintainers and capability commitments."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:223
msgid "8.4 Hardware：验证真实设备条件"
msgstr "8.4 Hardware: verify real device conditions"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:225
msgid ""
"HIL "
"admission先验证准确artifact、profile、board/silicon、fixture、station和必要instrument身份，再执行真实操作。检查IRQ/DMA、电气、timeout/cancel"
" settlement、极端负载、stack/pool high-water、掉电/恢复与产品deadline。"
msgstr ""
"HIL admission first validates exact artifact, profile, board/silicon, "
"fixture, station and required instrument identity, then performs real "
"operations. Check IRQ/DMA, electrical behavior, timeout/cancel settlement, "
"extreme loads, stack/pool high-water marks, power loss/recovery and product "
"deadlines."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:227
msgid ""
"空station、错image、错board、缺原始数据与仅host "
"model结果不能生成物理passed状态。记录仪器/fixture版本、校准和负载条件，避免把一块板的一次轻载结果扩展为所有density、Board和产品。"
msgstr ""
"Empty stations, wrong images/Boards, missing raw data and host-model-only "
"results cannot produce physical passed status. Record instrument/fixture "
"versions, calibration and load conditions; do not generalize one lightly "
"loaded run on one Board to every density, Board and product."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:229
msgid ""
"工具readiness与设备操作分开。只有admission测试通过时，状态仍是HIL tooling "
"ready；当前硬件延期期间，物理资格保持未执行。"
msgstr ""
"Tool readiness and device operations are separate. Admission tests alone "
"establish HIL tooling ready; while hardware is deferred, physical "
"qualification remains not executed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:231
msgid "8.5 Release：晋升同一候选产物"
msgstr "8.5 Release: promote the same candidate artifact"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:233
msgid ""
"release候选绑定准确source/dependency/config/environment、编译链接实况、ELF/BIN/HEX及相关证据。验证source"
" package、许可/SBOM、签名/来源和产品所需物理资格；发布责任人审查明确支持范围与恢复策略。"
msgstr ""
"Release candidates bind exact source/dependencies/configuration/environment,"
" actual compilation/linking, ELF/BIN/HEX and evidence. Verify source "
"packages, licenses/SBOM, signatures/provenance and required product physical"
" qualification. Release owners review explicit support scope and recovery "
"policy."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:235
msgid ""
"HIL或签名后的晋升使用同hashartifact，不重新构建一个名称相同的image。更改代码、配置、依赖或构建环境产生新候选，相关资格重新执行。source"
" SDK验收不自动建立binary ABI、签名、产品认证或LTS。"
msgstr ""
"After HIL or signing, promote artifacts with the same hashes rather than "
"rebuilding an image with the same name. Code, configuration, dependency or "
"environment changes create new candidates and rerun relevant qualification. "
"Source-SDK acceptance does not automatically establish binary ABI, "
"signatures, product certification or LTS."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:237
msgid "9. Provenance、hermetic与reproducible分开验收"
msgstr "9. Accept provenance, hermeticity and reproducibility separately"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:239
msgid "9.1 Provenance：输入与输出的可追溯关系"
msgstr "9.1 Provenance: traceable input/output relationships"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:241
msgid ""
"每个发布候选绑定一个唯一的完整输入元组：平台与产品source身份、外部package和依赖身份、assembly/SoC/Board/layout输入、resolved配置、工具环境、profile与生成器版本。每个产物文件记录内容hash。"
msgstr ""
"Every release candidate binds one complete input tuple: platform/product "
"source identities, external package/dependency identities, "
"assembly/SoC/Board/layout inputs, resolved configuration, tool environment, "
"profile and generator versions. Every artifact file has a content hash."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:243
msgid ""
"这里的一对一关系是“该候选的输入上下文对应该次构建产物”，不是“一个Git "
"SHA只能生成一个binary”。同一source有多个profile或Board时，形成不同候选记录；source "
"SHA不能替代artifact身份。字节相同的文件也可以出现在不同上下文，候选manifest必须保留各自来源。"
msgstr ""
"The one-to-one relationship means a candidate’s input context identifies "
"that build’s artifacts, not that a Git SHA can produce only one binary. "
"Different profiles or Boards create separate candidate records. Source SHAs "
"do not replace artifact identity. Identical bytes can appear in different "
"contexts; manifests retain each origin."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:245
msgid ""
"执行报告记录实际命令、exit、测试计划/实际枚举、编译数据库、链接输入与输出、raw log和hash引用。unsigned "
"hash能发现内容变化，不能证明发布者或审批者身份；正式attestation和签名另有trust policy。"
msgstr ""
"Execution reports retain actual commands, exits, planned/actually enumerated"
" tests, compile databases, link inputs/outputs, raw logs and hash "
"references. Unsigned hashes detect changes without proving publisher or "
"approver identity; formal attestations and signatures need their own trust "
"policy."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:247
msgid "9.2 Hermetic：只读取声明的输入"
msgstr "9.2 Hermeticity: read only declared inputs"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:249
msgid ""
"正式构建使用固定image和已校验依赖；准备下载与实际构建分离。构建阶段关闭网络，不读取任意宿主目录、开发者凭据、未声明环境配置或系统工具fallback。源码输入只读，输出在独立目录，禁止边构建边改source。"
msgstr ""
"Formal builds use pinned images and verified dependencies; downloading and "
"preparation are separate from building. Builds have no network and read no "
"arbitrary host directories, developer credentials, undeclared environment "
"settings or system-tool fallbacks. Sources are read-only, outputs separate, "
"and sources must not change during builds."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:251
msgid ""
"记录compiler/sysroot及其读取的工具环境，不仅记录compiler banner。固定tool版本和Git "
"revision本身不会使构建hermetic；声明Board输入也不会限制任意CMake代码访问其它目录。"
msgstr ""
"Record compiler/sysroot bytes and the tool environment they read, not just "
"compiler banners. Pinned tool versions and Git revisions alone do not make a"
" build hermetic; declared Board inputs do not constrain arbitrary CMake "
"access to other directories."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:253
msgid "9.3 Reproducible：相同输入重复得到相同输出"
msgstr ""
"9.3 Reproducibility: identical inputs repeatedly produce identical outputs"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:255
msgid ""
"用两次独立clean "
"build改变绝对目录和cache条件，比较目标ELF/BIN和声明可确定的package内容。固定`SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH`与path "
"mapping，控制archive顺序、mtime和生成文本；禁止当前时间和机器路径进入firmware身份之外的随机内容。"
msgstr ""
"Perform two independent clean builds with different absolute paths and cache"
" conditions; compare target ELF/BIN and declared deterministic package "
"contents. Fix `SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH` and path mapping, control archive order, "
"mtimes and generated text, and prevent current time or machine paths from "
"introducing incidental firmware differences."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:257
msgid ""
"执行时间、日志、签名和可确定payload分别存储，避免manifest自引用或把每次run "
"timestamp嵌入binary。对于需要随机性的签名/包装，明确比较范围，不用“忽略不同内容”制造bit-exact结论。"
msgstr ""
"Store execution times, logs, signatures and deterministic payload "
"separately. Avoid self-referential manifests and embedding run timestamps in"
" binaries. For randomized signatures/wrapping, define comparison scope; "
"ignoring arbitrary differences does not establish bit-exactness."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:259
msgid "只有独立重建比较完成才可声明可复现。固定container加hash、一次成功build或源码归档deterministic都不够。"
msgstr ""
"Claim reproducibility only after independent rebuild comparison. A pinned "
"container plus hashes, one successful build or a deterministic source "
"archive is insufficient."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:261
msgid "10. 证据模型与失败传播"
msgstr "10. Evidence models and failure propagation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:263
msgid ""
"使用一个版本化结果schema，表达run身份、planned/executed checks、exit/status、raw-"
"log/artifact引用、qualified scope与limitations。完整compile "
"database、map和log存为artifact，manifest引用，避免每个profile重复嵌套相同大文件。"
msgstr ""
"Use one versioned result schema for run identity, planned/executed checks, "
"exit/status, raw-log/artifact references, qualified scope and limitations. "
"Store full compile databases, maps and logs as referenced artifacts, rather "
"than nesting the same large files in every profile."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:265
msgid "mandatory检查缺失、零执行、全部skipped、过期或工具失败时，不输出passed。"
msgstr ""
"Missing mandatory checks, zero executions, entirely skipped runs, stale "
"results and tool failures never produce passed."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:266
msgid "明确区分passed、failed、not executed与unsupported；不把unsupported统计成已验证实现。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish passed, failed, not executed and unsupported; unsupported is not"
" a validated implementation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:267
msgid "source、配置或环境变化后，历史结果可保留作比较，但不能自动继承资格。"
msgstr ""
"Historical results remain useful comparisons after "
"source/configuration/environment changes but do not confer qualification "
"automatically."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:268
msgid "按风险解释测试结果和未关闭条件，不以“通过N项”掩盖未执行的关键验收。"
msgstr ""
"Explain results and unresolved conditions by risk; “N tests passed” must not"
" conceal unexecuted critical acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:269
msgid "summary由结果生成；workflow定义、target存在、角色文件和计划勾选不是执行证据。"
msgstr ""
"Generate summaries from results. Workflow definitions, existing targets, "
"role files and checked plan boxes are not execution evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:270
msgid "按candidate/run身份保存证据，引用不可变artifact；CI artifact传输期限不能成为长期支持记录的唯一存储。"
msgstr ""
"Retain evidence by candidate/run identity with immutable artifact "
"references. Expiring CI artifacts must not be the sole long-term support "
"record."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:272
msgid ""
"诊断日志保留实际错误与cleanup结果，避免每层重复包装成generic。任何工具失败都应保留可调查输出并返回非零，不能以生成一个空JSON或上传artifact成功替代检查成功。"
msgstr ""
"Diagnostics preserve actual errors and cleanup results rather than "
"repeatedly wrapping them as generic failures. Tool failures retain "
"investigable output and return nonzero; empty JSON or a successful artifact "
"upload does not establish successful checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:274
msgid "11. 十人的工作与review模型"
msgstr "11. Work and review model for ten people"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:276
msgid ""
"当前维护模式由Codex负责Arch/SoC/Board、I/O/OS、components、build/evidence和平台qualification全部领域。十人配置作为工作领域与容量计划，不要求具体人员。角色文件验证路径、备用领域和自动门禁，不创建虚构GitHub账号。"
msgstr ""
"Codex currently maintains all Arch/SoC/Board, I/O/OS, component, "
"build/evidence and platform-qualification domains. The ten-person "
"configuration describes work domains and capacity without requiring named "
"individuals. Role files validate paths, backup domains and automated gates; "
"they do not invent GitHub accounts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:278
msgid ""
"维护责任已指派与远程branch rules、独立人工review、credential或发布授权分别记录。产品决策和私有资格仍属于外部产品仓库。"
msgstr ""
"Assigned maintenance responsibilities, remote branch rules, independent "
"human review, credentials and release authorization are recorded separately."
" Product decisions and private qualification remain in external product "
"repositories."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:280
msgid "11.1 普通改动与高风险改动"
msgstr "11.1 Ordinary and high-risk changes"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:282
msgid ""
"普通内部实现执行领域审查和自动门禁。public API、依赖方向、IRQ/DMA/ownership、persistent "
"format、安全和发布链改变，还需独立agent或消费者跨层审查及实际失败路径证据。agent审查不声称独立人工批准；远程规则若要求人工review，仍按规则记录其真实状态。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary internal changes undergo domain review and automated gates. Public "
"APIs, dependency direction, IRQ/DMA/ownership, persistent formats, security "
"and release-chain changes also need independent agent or consumer cross-"
"layer review and executed failure-path evidence. Agent review is not "
"independent human approval; where remote rules require human review, record "
"its actual state."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:284
msgid ""
"不要为所有PR开架构委员会。小ADR只用于真实跨层决策，记录问题、决定、tradeoff、接口和验收；纯机械重命名使用普通PR说明。review主要检查合同、失败路径、并发、资源/时序与维护成本，格式交给工具。"
msgstr ""
"Do not convene an architecture committee for every PR. Small ADRs cover real"
" cross-layer decisions: problem, decision, tradeoff, interface and "
"acceptance. Mechanical renames use ordinary PR descriptions. Review "
"contracts, failure paths, concurrency, resources/timing and maintenance "
"cost; tools handle formatting."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:286
msgid ""
"变更单位要可review：一个可以解释清楚的行为与其调用方/测试/文档。不得把接口改造拆成多个长期红色中间状态。多个产品无法原子迁移时，提供明确窗口、兼容层owner和删除条件；兼容层不是永久第二套对象体系。"
msgstr ""
"Keep changes reviewable: one explainable behavior with its "
"callers/tests/docs. Do not split interface changes into prolonged broken "
"intermediate states. When products cannot migrate atomically, specify a "
"migration window, compatibility-layer owner and removal conditions; "
"compatibility is not a permanent second object system."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:288
msgid "11.2 工作项与退出状态"
msgstr "11.2 Work items and exit states"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:290
msgid ""
"每个工作项记录问题、owner、依赖、验收与风险。状态至少区分设计接受、实现完成、软件验收、物理验收、发布可用。必要外部条件单独列出，不把等待硬件或责任落实隐藏在implemented状态中。"
msgstr ""
"Each item records its problem, owner, dependencies, acceptance and risks. "
"Distinguish design accepted, implemented, software accepted, physically "
"accepted and releasable. List external prerequisites separately rather than "
"hiding hardware or responsibility gaps in implemented status."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:292
msgid ""
"工程评估关注可重复失败、逃逸缺陷、资源/时序风险与交付阻塞。不要用代码行数、PR数、测试数、总覆盖率或文档数量作为个人/模块绩效指标。覆盖信息用于寻找未验证路径，不单独证明可靠性。"
msgstr ""
"Engineering assessment focuses on repeatable failures, escaped defects, "
"resource/timing risks and delivery blockers. Lines of code, PR/test counts, "
"aggregate coverage and document counts are not individual/module performance"
" metrics. Coverage locates unverified paths without proving reliability "
"alone."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:294
msgid ""
"发布由实际产品owner与release责任人承担；HIL reviewer审查真实预算和资格范围，security/trust "
"owner审查签名与恢复策略。CI执行可自动证明的条件，不能替代人的产品决策。"
msgstr ""
"Actual product and release owners handle releases. HIL reviewers assess real"
" budgets and qualification scope; security/trust owners assess signing and "
"recovery policy. CI executes mechanically provable conditions without "
"replacing human product decisions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:296
msgid "12. 代码风格、注释与静态检查"
msgstr "12. Code style, comments and static checks"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:298
msgid "12.1 沿用现有formatter与命名规范"
msgstr "12.1 Preserve current formatter and naming rules"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:300
msgid ""
"代码格式沿用仓库根目录 [.clang-format](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/.clang-format) 与 "
"[.editorconfig](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/.editorconfig)，不另起格式口径。工具版本进入正式环境锁；现有配置声明兼容clang-format "
"14及以上，实际采用的版本须通过同配置验证，不把版本升级作为改变风格的机会。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve the root [.clang-format](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/.clang-format) and "
"[.editorconfig](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/.editorconfig) rather than creating a new style. Lock tool versions "
"in formal environments. The current configuration declares compatibility "
"with clang-format 14 and later; chosen versions must be verified against it,"
" without using upgrades to change style."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:302
msgid ""
"保持80列、4空格、禁止tab、K&R attached braces、类型侧pointer alignment（`char* ptr`）、switch"
" "
"case缩进、现有include排序和最多一个连续空行。控制语句不压成单行，普通函数体保持多行。长typed接口按现有formatter折行，不能为减少折行改成100列。UTF-8、LF、文件末尾换行及各文件类型缩进由EditorConfig约束。"
msgstr ""
"Keep 80 columns, four spaces, no tabs, attached K&R braces, type-side "
"pointer alignment (`char* ptr`), indented switch cases, current include "
"ordering and at most one consecutive blank line. Do not compress control "
"statements or ordinary function bodies into single lines. Long typed "
"interfaces wrap with the formatter rather than expanding to 100 columns. "
"EditorConfig specifies UTF-8, LF, final newlines and per-file indentation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:304
msgid ""
"命名沿用 [贡献指南](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/CONTRIBUTING.md) 和 [coding "
"standards](../sphinx/development/coding_standards.rst)：文件、函数和普通变量使用snake_case；函数与公共symbol使用现有模块前缀，如`nx_`、`osal_`；类型以`_t`结尾；宏、枚举值和常量使用UPPER_CASE。文件内静态变量使用`s_`前缀，全局变量使用`g_`并尽量避免；private函数和只在文件内使用的数据为static。优先普通函数、const"
" table和typed结构，避免宏生成隐藏控制流与清理动作。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the [contributing guide](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/CONTRIBUTING.md) and [coding "
"standards](../sphinx/development/coding_standards.rst): snake_case for "
"files/functions/ordinary variables; existing module prefixes such as `nx_` "
"and `osal_` for functions/public symbols; `_t` suffixes for types; "
"UPPER_CASE for macros/enumerators/constants. File-static variables use `s_`;"
" global variables use `g_` and should be avoided. Private functions and "
"file-local data are static. Prefer functions, const tables and typed "
"structures over macros hiding control flow or cleanup."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:306
msgid "文件按真实状态、生命周期和职责拆分。不能为追求文件短把同一个状态机切成大量`.inc`，也不能把所有接口塞进巨型umbrella头。"
msgstr ""
"Split files by actual state, lifecycle and responsibility. Do not fragment "
"one state machine into many `.inc` files to shorten files, or collect every "
"interface in a giant umbrella header."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:308
msgid "12.2 沿用Doxygen形式，完善合同内容"
msgstr "12.2 Preserve Doxygen form and improve contract content"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:310
msgid ""
"注释形式沿用 [现有注释规范](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/.kiro/steering/comment-"
"standards.md)。C/C++使用反斜杠Doxygen标签：`\\brief`、`\\param[in]`、`\\param[out]`、`\\param[in,out]`、`\\return`、`\\retval`、`\\details`和`\\note`；按现有模板对齐说明文本，不引入`@brief`风格。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the [existing comment standard](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/.kiro/steering/comment-"
"standards.md). C/C++ uses backslash Doxygen tags: `\\brief`, `\\param[in]`, "
"`\\param[out]`, `\\param[in,out]`, `\\return`, `\\retval`, `\\details` and "
"`\\note`. Align descriptions with current templates; do not introduce "
"`@brief` style."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:312
msgid ""
"public "
"header写完整参数方向、返回值、必要错误和共同合同。source不重复header中的`\\param`和`\\return`，使用`\\brief`、`\\details`、`\\note`说明实现；static"
" helper使用简化`\\brief`。结构体和枚举成员沿用`/**< ... */`；普通和行尾注释使用`/* ... "
"*/`，行尾前两个空格；section采用现有`/*---...---*/`模板。C/C++源码与文档内C/C++示例同样遵守这些形式。"
msgstr ""
"Public headers describe parameter directions, returns, necessary errors and "
"shared contracts. Sources do not repeat header `\\param`/`\\return` lists; "
"use `\\brief`, `\\details` and `\\note` for implementation, and simplified "
"`\\brief` for static helpers. Structure/enumeration members use `/**< ... "
"*/`; ordinary/trailing comments use `/* ... */`, with two spaces before "
"trailing comments. Sections use existing `/*---...---*/` templates. C/C++ "
"examples follow the same forms."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:314
msgid ""
"头文件保持含`\\file/\\brief/\\author`的文件头；C源文件保持含`\\version/\\date/\\copyright`的完整文件头，必要时增加`\\details`。既有更完整文件头与许可证声明保留，字段内容准确，不编造作者、版本、日期。Git和发布记录补充历史追踪，不替代文件头，也不要求给每个函数新增手写修改日志。"
msgstr ""
"Headers retain file headers containing `\\file/\\brief/\\author`; C sources "
"retain complete `\\version/\\date/\\copyright` headers, adding `\\details` "
"when needed. Preserve fuller existing headers and licenses. Keep fields "
"accurate without inventing authors, versions or dates. Git/release history "
"supplements rather than replaces file headers; functions do not need new "
"handwritten change logs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:316
msgid ""
"CMake和Shell沿用`#`注释；Python沿用`#`与三引号docstring。C/C++注释形式不套用到这些语言。第三方源码保持上游规范和许可声明。"
msgstr ""
"CMake and Shell use `#` comments; Python uses `#` and triple-quoted "
"docstrings. C/C++ comment forms do not apply to these languages. Third-party"
" sources retain upstream style and licenses."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:318
msgid "public API在以上现有形式中提供调用者需要的合同："
msgstr "Public APIs provide the caller’s contract in those existing forms:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "项目"
msgstr "Item"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "必须说明的含义"
msgstr "Required meaning"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "context"
msgstr "context"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "task/ISR、允许的IRQ优先级或mask条件、单core/SMP范围"
msgstr ""
"Task/ISR context, permitted IRQ priority or masking conditions, and single-"
"core/SMP scope."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "timing"
msgstr "timing"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "是否阻塞、timeout/deadline起点、单位、zero/forever含义与推进责任"
msgstr ""
"Blocking behavior, timeout/deadline origin, units, zero/forever meaning and "
"progression responsibility."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "ownership"
msgstr "ownership"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "谁持有对象、借用何时开始/结束、复制handle与close后的有效性"
msgstr ""
"Object ownership, borrow start/end, copied-handle behavior and validity "
"after close."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "callback"
msgstr "callback"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "运行context、lock状态、可否reentry、callback返回前后的借用状态"
msgstr ""
"Execution context, lock state, reentry permission and borrowing before/after"
" callback return."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "failure"
msgstr "failure"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "返回码、output有效性、remaining ownership、retry/recovery行为"
msgstr ""
"Return codes, output validity, remaining ownership and retry/recovery "
"behavior."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "resources"
msgstr "resources"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "固定容量、可能allocation、copy、worker与预算要求"
msgstr ""
"Fixed capacity, possible allocations, copies, workers and budget "
"requirements."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:329
msgid ""
"共用规则集中在type或模块contract，函数写必要差异，通过`\\details/\\note`等现有标签表达。内部注释解释硬件勘误、barrier、竞态和不变量，避免复述代码。保留已有可追溯需求和许可声明，不新增无来源的requirements编号；契约内容完善不改变现有注释展示风格。"
msgstr ""
"Put common rules on types or module contracts; functions document necessary "
"differences using existing `\\details/\\note` forms. Internal comments "
"explain errata, barriers, races and invariants rather than restating code. "
"Preserve traceable requirements and licenses without inventing requirement "
"IDs. Better contracts retain the current presentation style."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:331
msgid "TODO必须对应一个有owner和退出条件的工作项。注释中的能力、时序与“线程安全”声明需要具体范围，不能靠措辞替代证明。"
msgstr ""
"TODOs reference work items with owners and exit conditions. Capability, "
"timing and “thread-safe” claims need specific scope; wording does not "
"replace proof."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:333
msgid "12.3 精选warnings与静态规则"
msgstr "12.3 Selected warnings and static rules"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:335
msgid ""
"owned "
"production使用`Wall/Wextra`和经评审的prototype、shadow、conversion等规则；正式门禁阻断所选规则的新diagnostic。先确认规则在C11与支持toolchain下有稳定含义，不一次打开所有analyzer规则制造海量忽略。"
msgstr ""
"Owned production uses `Wall/Wextra` and reviewed prototype, shadow, "
"conversion and similar rules. Formal gates block new diagnostics in selected"
" rules. Establish stable meaning under C11 and supported toolchains before "
"enabling rules; do not enable every analyzer rule and produce mass ignores."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:337
msgid ""
"clang-tidy消费实际compile "
"commands与生成配置，只检查owned边界。vendor代码按其target独立处理；不能通过全局静音隐藏自身错误。每条suppression要有具体原因和局部范围，不提交无解释的全目录排除。"
msgstr ""
"clang-tidy consumes actual compile commands and generated configuration "
"within owned boundaries. Vendor targets are handled separately; global "
"silencing must not hide owned defects. Suppressions need specific reasons "
"and local scope; no unexplained whole-directory exclusions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:339
msgid ""
"Cppcheck "
"2.13不读取编译数据库中的`-isystem`。工具按每个真实翻译单元将其投影为`-I`，保留普通目录先于系统目录的搜索顺序；编译器ABI查询仍使用原始参数。分析边界与clang-"
"tidy一致：只对该翻译单元实际SYSTEM目录中、位于`vendors/`或`ext/`的第三方头文件逐一排除，并记录具体路径、规范路径与SHA-256。自有头文件、第三方实现文件、非SYSTEM目录及指向自有文件的别名仍接受检查；不能全局关闭诊断或重封基线。此边界用于分析自有代码，不能证明第三方代码没有缺陷。"
msgstr ""
"Cppcheck 2.13 does not read `-isystem` from compile databases. Tools project"
" it to `-I` per actual translation unit, preserving ordinary-before-system "
"search order; compiler ABI queries still use original arguments. Like clang-"
"tidy, analysis excludes individually only third-party headers under "
"`vendors/` or `ext/` that are in that translation unit’s actual SYSTEM "
"directories, recording paths, canonical paths and SHA-256. Owned headers, "
"third-party implementation files, non-SYSTEM directories and aliases to "
"owned files stay checked. No global diagnostic suppression or rebaselining. "
"This owned-code boundary does not prove third-party code defect-free."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:341
msgid ""
"本规则集是工程检查基线，不构成MISRA、功能安全或其他认证。若产品要求标准符合性，另立准确standard/version、覆盖范围、deviation、工具资格与独立review项目，不能仅凭`cert-*`或analyzer配置宣称合规。"
msgstr ""
"These rules form an engineering baseline, not MISRA, functional-safety or "
"other certification. Products requiring conformity need exact "
"standards/versions, scope, deviations, tool qualification and independent "
"review; `cert-*` or analyzer settings alone do not prove compliance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:343
msgid "12.4 当前落实与历史迁移"
msgstr "12.4 Current implementation and historical migration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:345
msgid ""
"原架构曾存在文件头、注释标签和格式不一致。本轮已经移除旧HAL/OSAL、Runtime及业务服务，将当前Core、I/O、OS、Arch、SoC、组件和测试按原有格式与反斜杠Doxygen规则统一。根`.clang-"
"format`和`.editorconfig`保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"The previous architecture had inconsistent file headers, comment tags and "
"formatting. This iteration removed old HAL/OSAL, Runtime and business "
"services and unified current Core, I/O, OS, Arch, SoC, components and tests "
"under existing formatting and backslash Doxygen rules. Root `.clang-format` "
"and `.editorconfig` are unchanged."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:347
msgid ""
"[格式目录清单](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/.clang-format-"
"dirs)覆盖所有维护中的C/C++与`.inc`，包括测量workload。[安装入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/scripts/setup/install_dev_tools.py)固定安装pre-commit 4.3.0和clang-format "
"14.0.6，并安装真实`pre-commit`、`commit-msg` hooks。默认提交检查暂存快照；手工`--files`、`--all-"
"files`检查工作区。CI运行相同的整文件门禁，静态分析消费实际编译数据库。"
msgstr ""
"The [format directory list](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/.clang-format-dirs) covers all maintained C/C++ and "
"`.inc` files, including measurement workloads. The "
"[installer](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/scripts/setup/install_dev_tools.py) pins `pre-commit` 4.3.0 and "
"clang-format 14.0.6 and installs real `pre-commit`/`commit-msg` hooks. "
"Default commit checks inspect staged snapshots; manual `--files`/`--all-"
"files` checks inspect worktrees. CI runs the same whole-file gates; static "
"analysis uses actual compile databases."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:349
msgid ""
"首次历史审计的596文件及337/291格式／注释欠账仅用于追溯。当前[冻结基线](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/style-"
"baseline.json)的两类欠账集合均为空；新源码全部按整文件规则检查，禁止增加或重封豁免。最终通过状态由当前提交的实际门禁报告决定，不能继承历史计数。归档原始记录与第三方源码分别保留自身身份，不冒充当前自有代码验收。"
msgstr ""
"The first audit’s 596 files and 337/291 formatting/comment debts are "
"historical traceability only. Both current [frozen "
"baseline](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/dependencies/style-baseline.json) debt sets are empty. All new source"
" passes whole-file rules, without new or rebased exemptions. Actual gates "
"for the current commit determine acceptance; historical counts cannot be "
"inherited. Archived records and third-party source retain their own "
"identities rather than posing as current owned-code acceptance."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:351
msgid ""
"环境锁、统一dev入口、源码SDK、ELF预算、离线复现和HIL工装已实现；准确范围见[交付说明](../delivery/README.md)。formatter负责排版，注释检查器只验证机械规则；API合同语义仍需review和行为测试。安全扫描诊断按维护范围逐项核对，不通过全局静音消除自身问题。软件检查不能替代实板时序、产品安全或标准符合性资格。"
msgstr ""
"Environment locks, the unified dev entry, source SDK, ELF budgets, offline "
"reproducibility and HIL tooling are implemented; see [delivery "
"scope](../delivery/README.md). Formatters handle layout and comment checkers"
" handle mechanical rules; API semantics still need review and behavioral "
"tests. Security diagnostics are reviewed within maintenance scope without "
"global silencing. Software checks do not replace physical timing, product "
"safety or conformity qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:353
msgid "13. 错误、所有权与并发API规范"
msgstr "13. Error, ownership and concurrent-API rules"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:355
msgid ""
"状态码保持少量、caller可以行动的类别：invalid input/state/context、unsupported、not "
"found、busy、full/empty、timeout/cancelled与I/O/integrity等。vendor raw "
"flags作为可选detail保留，不传播vendor类型，不把不同错误全部压成generic。"
msgstr ""
"Use a small set of actionable status classes: invalid input/state/context, "
"unsupported, not found, busy, full/empty, timeout/cancelled and "
"I/O/integrity errors. Optional vendor raw flags remain details without "
"leaking vendor types or flattening distinct errors into generic failures."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:357
msgid ""
"return status不自动触发global日志或global error callback；调用方决定策略。并发API不以global "
"errno/last-error作为权威结果。"
msgstr ""
"Return statuses do not trigger global logging or global error callbacks "
"automatically; callers choose policy. Concurrent APIs do not use global "
"errno/last-error as authoritative results."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:358
msgid "ISR诊断使用有界、可关闭的binary记录，字符串格式化和复杂存储在合适task进行。"
msgstr ""
"ISR diagnostics use bounded, disableable binary records. Suitable tasks "
"handle string formatting and complex storage."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:359
msgid ""
"状态与ownership正交。cancel accepted、terminal result和buffer "
"settled分别定义；`TIMEOUT/CANCELLED`单独不证明buffer已归还。"
msgstr ""
"Status and ownership are orthogonal. Define cancel acceptance, terminal "
"results and settled buffers separately; `TIMEOUT/CANCELLED` alone does not "
"prove buffers returned."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:360
msgid ""
"create/open或submit "
"admission被拒绝时不产生有效新handle/ticket、不建立新借用；已ACCEPTED请求的start/error/timeout属于该请求结果，不能倒退称为零借用拒绝。query/receive明确失败output是untouched还是invalid，禁止调用方猜测。"
msgstr ""
"Rejected create/open or submit admission creates no valid new handle/ticket "
"and no new borrow. Start/error/timeout after ACCEPTED belong to that "
"request’s result and cannot be relabeled as zero-borrow rejection. "
"Query/receive contracts state whether failure leaves outputs untouched or "
"invalid."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:361
msgid ""
"close失败保持既有引用与责任。rollback report分别保存原失败、cleanup失败和remaining "
"ownership，不能以第二个错误覆盖整个原因。"
msgstr ""
"Failed close preserves existing references and responsibilities. Rollback "
"reports separately retain the original failure, cleanup failure and "
"remaining ownership; a second error must not overwrite the reason."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:362
msgid "所有长度、offset和资源乘法在操作前检查。协议/持久化编码不依赖C struct padding、enum宽度或host endian。"
msgstr ""
"Check all lengths, offsets and resource multiplication before operations. "
"Protocol/persistence encoding does not depend on C structure padding, enum "
"width or host endianness."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:363
msgid ""
"`volatile`不构成线程/ISR同步。atomics、barrier与IRQ mask由明确Arch合同限定，不能把single-"
"core规则称为SMP安全。"
msgstr ""
"`volatile` is not task/ISR synchronization. Explicit Arch contracts govern "
"atomics, barriers and IRQ masks; single-core rules are not SMP safety."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:364
msgid "assert用于内部不变量和明确fail-stop，不代替可恢复输入/资源错误处理。production保持必要边界检查。"
msgstr ""
"Assertions express internal invariants and explicit fail-stop behavior, not "
"recoverable input/resource handling. Production retains necessary boundary "
"checks."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:366
msgid ""
"有限资源耗尽应返回合同中的失败，不循环直到“总有一天成功”。阻塞与retry必须有预算；后台推进责任由caller或明确组件worker承担，不能出现文档未声明的隐藏线程或timer。"
msgstr ""
"Finite-resource exhaustion returns contractual failure rather than looping "
"until eventual success. Blocking/retries need budgets; callers or explicit "
"component workers own progression. No undocumented hidden threads or timers."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:368
msgid "14. 工程批次与退出条件"
msgstr "14. Engineering batches and exit conditions"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:370
msgid "这些批次可以与平台实现垂直切片协同，但状态必须由实际结果关闭。时间和人数不能替代退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"Batches may accompany vertical platform slices, but actual results close "
"their status. Time and headcount do not replace exit conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "批次"
msgstr "Batch"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "交付与退出条件"
msgstr "Deliverables and exit conditions"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E1 工具与入口"
msgstr "E1 Tools and entry points"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "fresh checkout进入锁定环境；一个薄入口调用标准build/test工具；local与CI共享实现，版本不再多处定义"
msgstr ""
"A fresh checkout enters the locked environment; one thin entry calls "
"standard build/test tools; local and CI share implementation and one version"
" authority."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E2 配置与接入"
msgstr "E2 Configuration and integration"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid ""
"assembly/SoC/Board一次解析产生resolved "
"bundle；矛盾/unsupported失败；真实外部product与Board接入；public/private/vendor编译边界有正反验证"
msgstr ""
"One assembly/SoC/Board resolution creates the resolved bundle; "
"contradictory/unsupported inputs fail; real external products/Boards "
"integrate; positive and negative public/private/vendor compile-boundary "
"checks pass."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E3 垂直合同与代码规范"
msgstr "E3 Vertical contracts and code rules"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid ""
"一个端到端切片完整处理成功、失败、context、ownership与预算；C11 production/C++ "
"test隔离；formatter和精选规则实际执行"
msgstr ""
"An end-to-end slice handles success, failure, context, ownership and "
"budgets; C11 production/C++ tests are isolated; formatter and selected rules"
" actually execute."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E4 软件流水线与证据"
msgstr "E4 Software pipelines and evidence"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid ""
"PR/nightly风险矩阵执行；缺失/零执行/skipped/stale结果实际拒绝；产物资源越界实际阻断；重复旧入口删除，结果绑定准确输入与artifact"
msgstr ""
"PR/nightly risk matrices execute; missing/zero/skipped/stale results are "
"actually rejected; resource overruns are blocked; duplicate old entries are "
"removed; results bind exact inputs and artifacts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E5 hermetic与HIL准备"
msgstr "E5 Hermetic builds and HIL preparation"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid ""
"无网络正式build成功；独立clean rebuild比较完成；HIL admission拒绝错artifact/profile/empty "
"station；物理资格继续未执行直到真实测量"
msgstr ""
"Formal network-disabled builds pass; independent clean rebuilds compare; HIL"
" admission rejects wrong artifacts/profiles/empty stations; physical "
"qualification remains unexecuted until real measurements."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "E6 产品发布资格"
msgstr "E6 Product release qualification"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid ""
"产品所需物理、安全、恢复与负载预算有真实证据和reviewer；sealed "
"candidate签名与来源验证完成；同hashartifact晋升；责任人与支持范围真实落实"
msgstr ""
"Actual evidence and reviewers cover physical, safety, recovery and load "
"budgets; sealed candidates pass signature/provenance verification; "
"identical-hash artifacts are promoted; responsibility and support scope are "
"real."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:381
msgid ""
"E1至E4可形成完整软件工程交付。E5中的工具readiness、hermetic与reproducible各自验收；HIL实际执行独立关闭。E6不能由本文、计划表或软件通过数量代替。"
msgstr ""
"E1–E4 deliver a complete software engineering system. Tool readiness, "
"hermeticity and reproducibility in E5 are accepted separately; actual HIL "
"closes independently. Neither this handbook, a plan nor software pass counts"
" replaces E6."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:383
msgid ""
"E1–E6描述工程验收领域，不是另一套排期或任务真源。唯一实施任务表是 {download}`执行清单 <next-generation-"
"execution.csv>` "
"的B0–B6：E1/E2在B1建立，E3随B2–B4切片执行，E4/E5在B5收束，B6只封存软件候选；E6待外部产品和实际硬件证据齐备后另行完成。"
msgstr ""
"E1–E6 describe acceptance domains, not another schedule or task authority. "
"The sole implementation ledger is B0–B6 in {download}`execution checklist "
"<next-generation-execution.csv>`: E1/E2 start in B1; E3 runs through B2–B4 "
"slices; E4/E5 converge in B5; B6 seals only software candidates. E6 "
"completes later when external products and actual hardware evidence are "
"ready."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:385
msgid "15. 首个落地切片"
msgstr "15. First implementation slice"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:387
msgid ""
"先用一个精确Board、一个OS/backend和一个外部产品完成fresh checkout到真实consumer "
"build，再扩展第二backend和第二SoC。第一切片需同时包含一个小typed "
"I/O、错误/cleanup路径、资源预算、public/private include边界和原始产物证据。"
msgstr ""
"First take one exact Board, one OS/backend and one external product from a "
"fresh checkout to a real consumer build, then expand to another backend and "
"SoC. The slice includes small typed I/O, error/cleanup paths, budgets, "
"public/private include boundaries and raw artifact evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:389
msgid ""
"工具、schema、CMake模块和review规则应由这个切片证明需要。每扩展一种组合，都增加实际验证及维护责任；不先构造庞大通用框架，再用空fixture宣布工程模型完成。"
msgstr ""
"Let this slice justify tools, schemas, CMake modules and review rules. Every"
" new combination adds executed validation and maintenance responsibility. Do"
" not build a vast framework first and claim completion through empty "
"fixtures."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:391
msgid "16. TDD 与 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 强制开发合同"
msgstr "16. Mandatory TDD and GoogleTest/GoogleMock development contract"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:393
msgid ""
"新增生产行为和缺陷修复遵循 RED → GREEN → "
"REFACTOR。先从公开合同编写可失败的测试，执行并确认失败原因是所需行为尚未实现，再以最小正确实现让测试通过，最后整理实现并重复相关测试。新 API"
" 尚不存在时，首次编译失败可以记录接口 RED；接口建立后还要实际执行行为测试。已经存在的行为补回归不能宣称历史上采用了 TDD。"
msgstr ""
"New production behavior and defect fixes follow RED → GREEN → REFACTOR: "
"write a failing public-contract test first, execute it and verify that "
"required behavior is missing, implement the smallest correct change, then "
"refactor and rerun relevant tests. For new APIs, initial compile failure may"
" establish interface RED; executable behavior tests follow once the "
"interface exists. Retrofitting regressions for existing behavior does not "
"prove historical TDD."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:395
msgid ""
"GoogleTest 承担断言、fixture 和边界场景；GoogleMock 只替代硬件、时间、通知和执行器等依赖端口。测试实际调用 Nexus "
"的公共 API，不能把被测 provider、factory 或 owner 整体 mock "
"掉，再用期望调用证明自身正确。优先检查不同实例的隔离、零副作用拒绝、资源冲突、deadline、取消后的排空和最终发布顺序。正常路径和失败路径共同确定合同，不要求为了数字重复实现细节。"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest provides assertions, fixtures and boundary cases; GoogleMock "
"replaces only dependency ports such as hardware, time, notification and "
"executors. Tests call actual public Nexus APIs rather than mocking entire "
"providers, factories or owners and proving their own expectations. "
"Prioritize instance isolation, zero-side-effect rejection, resource "
"conflicts, deadlines, post-cancel draining and final publication order. "
"Success and failure together define the contract; do not duplicate "
"implementation details for counts."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:399
msgid "统一执行入口为："
msgstr "Unified execution entry:"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:410
msgid ""
"每项行为变更的评审说明包含失败测试名称、RED 命令及实际失败原因、GREEN "
"命令和相关场景覆盖。代码评审检查测试是否先定义了可观察合同。自动化能够证明真实执行、报告完整性和当前源码验证，无法机械证明所有开发者历史上遵守了测试先行顺序；因此不能把一个绿灯当作"
" TDD 流程全部合规。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior-change reviews name failing tests, actual RED commands/reasons, "
"GREEN commands and scenario coverage. Review checks whether tests first "
"define observable contracts. Automation proves execution, report integrity "
"and validation of current source, but cannot mechanically prove every "
"developer’s historical test-first ordering. One green gate is not complete "
"TDD-process compliance."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:167
msgid "6.4 下载缓存只复用锁定的工具归档"
msgstr "6.4 Download caches reuse only locked tool archives"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:171
msgid ""
"缓存不包含验收结论。每次验证仍实际执行检查，生成本次源码和工具身份对应的新报告；旧 "
"JUnit、分析报告和成功收条不能作为缓存命中的成功结果。正式离线构建与双 clean build 的要求保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"A cache contains no acceptance conclusion. Each verification still executes "
"the checks and produces fresh reports for the current source and tool "
"identities. Old JUnit, analysis reports and success receipts cannot stand in"
" for a successful cache hit. Formal offline builds and two independent clean"
" builds remain required."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:213
msgid ""
"完整提交前先执行便宜预检：格式与注释、输入/schema、catalogue/preset/实例选择一致性、生成代码及受影响 target "
"的编译链接。先消除这些确定性错误，再冻结同一个功能增量，执行普通完整暂存快照门禁。预检不删除完整门禁中的检查，不使用 filter、shard、SKIP"
" 或 hook bypass 换取通过。"
msgstr ""
"Before the complete commit gate, run inexpensive preflight checks: "
"formatting and comments, input/schema validation, catalogue/preset/instance-"
"selection consistency, generated code, and compilation and linking of "
"affected targets. Remove these deterministic errors first, then freeze the "
"same functional increment and run the ordinary complete staged-snapshot "
"gate. Preflight does not remove checks from the complete gate or use "
"filters, shards, SKIP or hook bypasses to obtain a pass."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:225
msgid "模式无关的完整边界合同与 FreeRTOS 工具套件分别使用以下入口；它们的报告独立，不计作 Native sanitizer 覆盖："
msgstr ""
"Use the following entry points for the complete mode-independent boundary "
"contracts and the FreeRTOS tool suite. Their reports are separate and do not"
" count as Native sanitizer coverage:"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:295
msgid ""
"计时报告分别记录端到端墙钟、并行任务累计运行时间和父子命令关系。嵌套子命令不与父命令重复相加；排队、准备、构建、测试、分析及失败重跑分别标明范围。对未计时的编辑、分析或等待不推算百分比，不把"
" runner 分钟称为用户等待时间；提速结论需同输入与同条件的实际前后执行。"
msgstr ""
"Timing reports distinguish end-to-end wall time, cumulative runtime of "
"parallel jobs, and parent/child command relationships. Do not add nested "
"child durations to their parent duration. Identify the scope of queueing, "
"preparation, build, test, analysis and failed reruns separately. Do not "
"infer percentages for unmeasured editing, analysis or waiting, or describe "
"runner minutes as user waiting time. Speedup claims require actual "
"before/after execution with the same inputs and conditions."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:297
msgid ""
"关键源码、输入 "
"manifest、原始失败输出和最终执行收条放在持久位置。临时目录用于可再生构建缓存，不能成为唯一可恢复的交付记录。证据只保存一份可校验原件并引用；普通迭代不再建立平行状态页、运输副本或新证据框架。"
msgstr ""
"Keep critical source, input manifests, original failure output and final "
"execution receipts in persistent storage. Temporary directories hold "
"regenerable build caches and must not be the only recoverable delivery "
"record. Keep one verifiable original evidence copy and reference it. Routine"
" iterations must not establish parallel status pages, transport copies or "
"new evidence frameworks."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:313
msgid ""
"按完整功能增量提交：实现、配置/实例、支持清单、相关回归、双语合同及唯一证据附件一起收敛。开发期间执行聚焦的 RED/GREEN "
"和便宜预检，收敛后只对冻结输入执行一次普通完整门禁；若随后修改行为，相关验证重新执行。不要为了提交数量把紧密关联的修复、清单或日志拆成反复触发全门禁的附属提交，也不要合并无关功能来掩盖评审边界。"
msgstr ""
"Commit complete functional increments: converge implementation, "
"configuration/instances, support catalogues, relevant regressions, bilingual"
" contracts and one evidence attachment together. During development, run "
"focused RED/GREEN checks and inexpensive preflight. After convergence, run "
"the ordinary complete gate once on frozen inputs; later behavior changes "
"require the relevant validation again. Do not split tightly related fixes, "
"catalogues or logs into ancillary commits that repeatedly trigger the full "
"gate merely to increase commit counts. Do not combine unrelated features in "
"a way that obscures review boundaries."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:366
msgid ""
"静态分析只对相同的真实编译上下文去重：同一规范源码、工作目录、编译器和完整有序语义参数。只剥除已明确识别的输出文件与依赖文件生成参数；宏、include"
" "
"搜索顺序、CPU/ABI、语言标准、优化或插桩不同的条目分别保留，不能只按源码路径合并。报告同时记录原始条目、去重后上下文与代表条目的对应关系；去重改变调度，不改变规则、诊断或失败传播。"
msgstr ""
"Deduplicate static analysis only for identical actual compilation contexts: "
"the same canonical source, working directory, compiler and complete ordered "
"semantic arguments. Strip only explicitly recognized output-file and "
"dependency-file generation arguments. Entries with different macros, include"
" search order, CPU/ABI, language standard, optimization or instrumentation "
"remain separate; never merge by source path alone. Reports record the "
"original entries, deduplicated contexts and their mapping to representative "
"entries. Deduplication changes scheduling, not rules, diagnostics or failure"
" propagation."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:368
msgid ""
"分析并行度必须有正整数上限，按可用内存与 runner 容量选择；默认串行，CI 可显式使用 `--parallel "
"2`。各子进程使用独立输出，全部退出后再汇总；任一执行失败或诊断越界仍失败。超时或取消必须停止并回收已启动进程，不能留下后台分析，也不能把空报告当成功。并行执行时间与任务累计时间分别报告。"
msgstr ""
"Analysis parallelism must have a positive integer limit selected for "
"available memory and runner capacity. The default is serial; CI may "
"explicitly use `--parallel 2`. Child processes use separate outputs, and "
"aggregation waits for all exits. Any execution failure or diagnostic outside"
" the allowed boundary still fails. Timeouts and cancellation must stop and "
"reap started processes, leave no background analysis, and never treat an "
"empty report as success. Report elapsed parallel time and cumulative task "
"time separately."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:437
msgid ""
"第一条命令运行提交门禁的四个完整工具域，配置并构建 "
"`nexus_google_contracts`，从各二进制发现完整用例，随后执行不带筛选的实际测试。它移除环境中的 GoogleTest "
"filter/shard 设置，删除旧 XML，拒绝零用例、未执行、跳过、失败、过期报告和发现数不符，并在 `build/<preset>/tdd/` "
"保存原始输出、GoogleTest XML 和汇总。第二条命令执行该 Native preset 的全部 CTest 编译相关模型与 "
"GoogleTest 回归；模式无关工具合同在显式 CI 工具域执行，不再由每个 Native preset 重复运行。两者不能互相替代。"
msgstr ""
"The first command runs the four complete tool domains of the commit gate, "
"configures and builds `nexus_google_contracts`, discovers the complete cases"
" from each binary, then executes the actual tests without filtering. It "
"removes GoogleTest filter/shard settings from the environment, deletes old "
"XML, rejects zero cases, nonexecution, skips, failures, stale reports and "
"mismatches with discovery, and preserves raw output, GoogleTest XML and "
"summaries in `build/<preset>/tdd/`. The second command runs all compilation-"
"dependent CTest models and GoogleTest regressions for that Native preset. "
"Mode-independent tool contracts run in the explicit CI tool domain instead "
"of repeating in each Native preset. Neither execution replaces the other."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:443
msgid "16.1 测试保留、合并与删除"
msgstr "16.1 Retaining, merging and deleting tests"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:445
msgid ""
"测试的价值由可观察合同、独立故障路径和历史缺陷决定，不由文件数或断言数决定。保留正常、边界、拒绝、故障与恢复中有独立风险的场景；硬件模型、ARM "
"链接和真实 HIL 验证不同事实，即使调用相同 API 也不因此重复。"
msgstr ""
"A test earns its place through an observable contract, an independent "
"failure path or a historical defect, not through file or assertion counts. "
"Retain distinct risks across normal, boundary, rejection, failure and "
"recovery scenarios. Hardware models, ARM linking and actual HIL establish "
"different facts; calling the same API does not make them duplicates."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "决策"
msgstr "Decision"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "必须满足的条件"
msgstr "Required conditions"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "保留"
msgstr "Retain"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "能指出合同或故障回归、受测生产路径、独立 oracle，以及失败能阻止的具体缺陷"
msgstr ""
"Identify the contract or defect regression, the production path under test, "
"an independent oracle and the specific defect that a failure prevents"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "合并"
msgstr "Merge"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "输入、执行上下文、故障注入和可观察断言等价；评审映射原用例身份到替代用例，保留独立合同场景与诊断，避免一个失败遮住后续场景"
msgstr ""
"Inputs, execution context, fault injection and observable assertions are "
"equivalent. The review maps original case identities to replacements, "
"retains distinct contract scenarios and diagnostics, and prevents one "
"failure from hiding subsequent scenarios"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "删除"
msgstr "Delete"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:0
msgid "已失效行为明确移除，或完整等价场景由维护中的测试接替；评审记录旧用例身份、原因及替代用例/合同，执行替代套件并确认注册完整"
msgstr ""
"Obsolete behavior is explicitly removed, or a maintained test takes over the"
" complete equivalent scenario. The review records the old case identity, "
"reason and replacement case/contract, executes the replacement suite and "
"confirms complete registration"

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:453
msgid ""
"独立 oracle "
"来自公开合同、准确数据手册事实或预先固定的错误/输出；不能调用被测解析器计算期望值，再用同一结果证明解析器正确。生成代码要通过实际编译链接或行为验证，不能只检查生成器与自己构造的模板相同。"
msgstr ""
"An independent oracle comes from a public contract, precise datasheet facts "
"or predetermined errors/outputs. Do not call the parser under test to "
"calculate an expectation and then use that same result to prove the parser "
"correct. Generated code must undergo actual compilation/linking or "
"behavioral verification; matching a generator to a template constructed by "
"itself is insufficient."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:455
msgid ""
"删除只证明测试调用自身、重复常量/实现分支、既无合同结果也无必要副作用/顺序的调用断言，或机械固定当前条数的自证断言。若它们还承担失败传播、枚举完整性或实际构建职责，先补足该合同再删除；报告检查器仍须拒绝零执行、失败、跳过及发现/执行不符。不得以数量变少为优化成果，或用放宽断言、跳过用例、扩大"
" mock 边界维持绿灯。"
msgstr ""
"Remove assertions that only prove a test calls itself, repeat constants or "
"implementation branches, check calls without a contract result or necessary "
"side effect/order, or mechanically freeze the current test count. If they "
"also verify failure propagation, enumeration completeness or actual builds, "
"first preserve that contract in a suitable test. Report checkers must still "
"reject zero execution, failures, skips and discovery/execution mismatches. "
"Fewer cases alone are not an optimization result. Do not weaken assertions, "
"skip cases or widen mock boundaries to keep a green result."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:457
msgid ""
"复用一次重型 fixture "
"或将等价输入参数化时，每个合同场景仍独立枚举、可定位失败，并保持所需状态隔离。只复用不可变输入和已证明无残留的准备步骤；涉及冷启动、失败污染、借用或恢复的场景不能共享未经重置的实例。测试删除和执行域迁移属于行为变更，按同一"
" TDD、评审与完整门禁约束验收。"
msgstr ""
"When reusing a heavy fixture or parameterizing equivalent inputs, enumerate "
"each contract scenario separately, keep failures identifiable and preserve "
"required state isolation. Reuse only immutable inputs and preparation steps "
"proven to leave no residual state. Scenarios involving cold starts, failure "
"contamination, borrows or recovery must not share an instance that has not "
"been reset. Test deletion and execution-domain migration are behavior "
"changes subject to the same TDD, review and complete-gate requirements."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:169
msgid ""
"工具准备可以缓存归档；每次命中仍按环境锁中的 SHA-256 "
"核对完整归档字节，校验通过后才解压。缓存键包含锁定归档身份，不能用分支名、版本字符串或旧安装目录代替内容校验。下载失败采用有限次数和超时重试；临时文件校验完成后才原子发布，耗尽预算返回非零，不能改源、降版本或跳过校验。"
msgstr ""
"Tool preparation may cache archives. Every cache hit must still verify all "
"archive bytes against the SHA-256 in the environment lock before extraction."
" Cache keys include the locked archive identity; a branch name, version "
"string or old installation directory cannot replace content verification. "
"Downloads use bounded attempts and timeouts. A temporary file is published "
"atomically only after verification; exhaustion returns nonzero and must not "
"change the source, downgrade the tool or skip verification."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:223
msgid ""
"普通提交继续执行 testing、configure、ci、workflows 四个完整工具域及 GoogleTest "
"gate；耗时较长的迁移、SDK/HIL 边界合同由显式 CI "
"工具域执行，不重复加入提交门禁。工具报告按明确的域记录实际发现/执行、skip、error 与计数；GoogleTest "
"报告保留用例身份。域迁移审查另行核对原模块/用例集合及替代映射，并验证旧注册移除、新位置非零执行以及必需 CI 依赖，不能留下无人执行的套件。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary commits continue to execute the four complete tool domains, "
"testing, configure, ci and workflows, plus the GoogleTest gate. The longer "
"migration and SDK/HIL boundary contracts run in the explicit CI tool domain "
"and are not added again to the commit gate. Tool reports identify the domain"
" and record actual discovery/execution, skips, errors and counts. GoogleTest"
" reports retain case identities. A domain-migration review separately checks"
" the original module/case set and replacement mapping, and verifies removal "
"from the old location, nonzero execution in the new location and the "
"required CI dependency, so no suite loses its execution owner."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:221
msgid ""
"执行按验证对象分域。Native Debug、Release、ASan/UBSan、TSan 的 CTest 保留全部编译相关 C 模型和 "
"GoogleTest 程序；这些模式的编译选项与运行时检查不同，不能相互替代。与父模式无关的 Python、固定 profile 的 SDK 子构建及 "
"FreeRTOS 工具合同，在显式 CI 工具域完整执行一次，不能在四个 Native preset "
"中重复注册，也不能因此删除用例。若子构建确实消费父模式，必须在计划中记录该传递并保留所需矩阵。"
msgstr ""
"Separate execution by what is being verified. Native Debug, Release, "
"ASan/UBSan and TSan CTest runs retain all compilation-dependent C models and"
" GoogleTest programs. Their compiler options and runtime checks differ, so "
"one mode cannot replace another. Python checks, SDK sub-builds with a fixed "
"profile, and FreeRTOS tool contracts that do not depend on the parent mode "
"run completely once in an explicit CI tool domain. They must not be "
"registered repeatedly in all four Native presets, and their cases must not "
"be deleted. If a sub-build actually consumes the parent mode, record that "
"propagation in the plan and retain the required matrix."

#: ../../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:439
msgid ""
"已安装的 pre-commit hook 对生产、测试、配置和构建行为变更执行同一 GoogleTest gate；只改说明文档无需重建。hook "
"在执行前后检查未暂存／未跟踪的行为改动，并比较起止 `git write-"
"tree`，要求暂存区内容完全一致。执行过程中修改或重新暂存源码会拒绝验收，不生成新的汇总，避免工作区修复或并发编辑误认证即将提交的源码。CI 通过完整"
" Native 计划和显式工具域独立验证相应合同，不依赖贡献者本地是否安装或运行 hook。`--no-verify`、`SKIP`、禁用测试或手写 "
"XML 不构成有效验收。"
msgstr ""
"The installed pre-commit hook runs the same GoogleTest gate for changes to "
"production, tests, configuration and build behavior. Prose-only changes do "
"not require a rebuild. Before and after execution, the hook checks "
"unstaged/untracked behavior changes and compares the initial and final `git "
"write-tree`, requiring an identical staged tree. Editing or restaging source"
" during execution rejects acceptance and produces no new summary, preventing"
" workspace fixes or concurrent edits from falsely certifying the source "
"about to be committed. CI independently verifies the corresponding contracts"
" through the complete Native plan and explicit tool domains, regardless of "
"whether a contributor installed or ran local hooks. `--no-verify`, `SKIP`, "
"disabled tests or handwritten XML do not constitute valid acceptance."

msgid ""
"框架源通过 Git 子模块 `ext/googletest` 引入，`dependencies/googletest.lock.json` 与 "
"Gitlink 固定同一版本和准确 commit；当前为 "
"1.16.0、`6910c9d9165801d8827d628cb72eb7ea9dd538c5`。依赖准备显式执行，CMake "
"只使用已准备的本地源码，不下载、不回退到系统框架；缺失、版本不符或子模块工作区有修改即失败。`tests/google/CMakeLists.txt` "
"启用 C++17，并保持依赖在 Native 测试树内。ARM、关闭测试的构建和 source SDK 消费者不获得 C++ runtime "
"或测试框架依赖。许可与 notice 随锁定的子模块源码保留。"
msgstr ""
"`ext/googletest` is a Git submodule; `dependencies/googletest.lock.json` and"
" the Gitlink pin the same version and exact commit, currently 1.16.0 at "
"`6910c9d9165801d8827d628cb72eb7ea9dd538c5`. Dependency preparation is "
"explicit. CMake uses only prepared local source, with no downloads or "
"system-framework fallback; missing source, a revision mismatch or a modified"
" submodule worktree fails. `tests/google/CMakeLists.txt` enables C++17 only "
"in the Native test tree. ARM builds, tests-disabled builds and source-SDK "
"consumers receive no C++ runtime or testing-framework dependency. The pinned"
" submodule source retains its license and notices."

#: ../../nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/engineering-handbook.md:167
msgid ""
"主平台 CI 对每个 `pull_request` 执行适用的完整检查域；`push` 只跟踪 `main` 和 `develop`，避免同一 "
"feature 提交同时触发 push／PR 两套完整流水线。手工和定时入口 继续保留。事件去重不删减 PR 检查、模式矩阵或正式候选验收。"
msgstr ""
"The main platform CI runs all applicable complete check domains for every "
"`pull_request`. Its `push` trigger follows only `main` and `develop`, "
"avoiding two complete push/PR pipelines for the same feature commit. Manual "
"and scheduled entry points remain available. Event deduplication does not "
"remove PR checks, mode matrices or formal candidate acceptance."

msgid ""
"普通可重定位 source SDK 的验收证明搬移后能够配置、构建、链接和运行，不保证任意 安装路径生成相同 ELF。未配置 path "
"mapping 时，故障位置的 `__FILE__` 字符串可以 包含 SDK 绝对路径；路径长度和链接对齐会影响 Flash 字节数。因此不同"
" SDK 前缀下的 静态成本差值不能直接解释为资源优化。当前 C11 固件的正式复现工具为源码、consumer 和构建目录设置 "
"`-ffile-prefix-map`，并比较两次实际 ELF/BIN；仍须执行该流程才能声明 逐字节可复现。"
msgstr ""
"Ordinary relocatable source-SDK acceptance establishes configuration, "
"building, linking and execution after relocation; it does not guarantee "
"identical ELFs at arbitrary installation paths. Without path mapping, "
"fault location `__FILE__` strings can contain absolute SDK paths; path "
"length and link alignment can change Flash bytes. Static-cost "
"differences across SDK prefixes therefore cannot directly establish "
"resource optimization. The formal reproduction tools for current C11 "
"firmware apply `-ffile-prefix-map` to source, consumer and build "
"directories and compare two actual ELF/BIN outputs. That process must "
"still execute before claiming byte-for-byte reproducibility."

msgid "`drivers/`"
msgstr "`drivers/`"

msgid "经复核的共享 IP 寄存器算法，由所选 SoC target 私有选编"
msgstr "Reviewed shared IP register algorithms, selected privately by the SoC target"
